      "tier": 1,
      "spec": [
        "docs/04-suite-design.md section 12 (more approvals needed: accepted and blocked; trust-task-next-step)",
        "SPEC.md:1414 (8.6: a held task is answered with a next step, never an error)",
        "SPEC.md:1417 (an approval by someone else: expects names a task to learn the outcome or, where there is none, the originating Type URI with continuation resubmit)",
        "docs/06-truststackers-conformance-plan.md section 3.9 (2PC-003: pending proposals visible only through next-step)"
      ],
