      "title": "the deadline is enforced on the participant path: a late approval is refused deadlineLapsed, the begin document ends errored, and a second late approval gets the same refusal",
      "tier": 2,
      "spec": [
        "docs/04-suite-design.md section 12 (deadline lapses while pending: errored, taskFailed, details.reason deadlineLapsed)",
        "docs/decisions/README.md section Holds, ceremonies and relationship credentials (deadlineLapsed, not expired)",
        "docs/06-truststackers-conformance-plan.md section 3.9 (2PC-004: expiry enforced on the participant path)"
      ],
      "source": {
